{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12339","headline":"长安落第作 · 钱起","name":"长安落第作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始愿今如此，前途复若何。\n无媒献词赋，生事日蹉跎。\n不遇张华识，空悲甯戚歌。\n故山归梦远，新岁客愁多。\n刷羽思乔木，登龙恨失波。\n散才非世用，回音谢云萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}